	(text "BONK RC Transmitter | Spectral Systems | CERN-OHL-P-2.0\ngithub.com/tyke01/\n\nCONVENTIONS\nGND = switched negative (P-), BAT- = raw cell negative.\nSPI shared: TFT (CS), nRF24 (CSN). I2C: INA226 @ 0x40.\nBattery current: + discharge, - charge. PWR_FLAGs are ERC-only.\n\nESP32\nSticks/pots on ADC1 (works with WiFi on). GPIO34-39 input-only.\nIO0/2/5/12/15 are strapping pins. SD0-3, CMD, CLK: flash, leave NC.\n\nPOWER\nLoad sharing: USB in, D3 feeds VSYS and Q3 is off. USB out, Q3 on.\nCharger: I = 1200/R24 (~1.1 A). TEMP grounded. D4 charging, D5 full.\nDW01A: cuts BAT- from GND on fault. R26 is sense only.\nINA226: 20 mOhm shunt, ~+/-4 A range.\nAP2112K: 3V3 sags below ~3.5 V battery; cut off in firmware.\n\nUSB / BOOT\nCC 5k1 = sink. USBLC6 = ESD. DTR/RTS auto-reset via Q1/Q2.\nEN RC delay: R18/C13. Encoder: 10k/10nF debounce."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 313.69 220.98 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.651 1.651)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "b6564d74-3515-4316-a683-80529697aef4")
	)
